## Grund citation rendering

In repositories with a `grund.toml` (at the root or under `.agents/`): in local conversations render each citation as a Markdown link whose visible text is the citation itself and whose target is `file://<absolute path>#L<line>` for the declaration; fall back to the bare citation when unsure. Elsewhere, ignore this.
<!-- <<< grund integrations citation rendering (v4) <<< -->

